      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The diagnosis of acute or chronic pain syndromes of the urogenital system can be verified and successfully treated by exact exploration of the patients medical history, the physical examination and a few image-guided or laboratory analyses Pain conditions which remain of unknown etiology even after extensive investigations are difficult to treat by the urologist alone. In cases where no causally determined morphological changes can be found or the alteration is disproportionate to the discomfort sensed by the patient, a multidisciplinary therapy strategy offers an approach to find a solution."},
